\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/f14154224936335b3eab7f9b977c5674.mp4?t=1755174017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/ebcda0535ac483ffaa346577da5c6ed2.poster.avif?t=1755174017\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/ebcda0535ac483ffaa346577da5c6ed2.webm?t=1755174017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/ebcda0535ac483ffaa346577da5c6ed2.mp4?t=1755174017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/5a4f4e2954ba3f4fd542d62886de997b.poster.avif?t=1755174017\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/5a4f4e2954ba3f4fd542d62886de997b.webm?t=1755174017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/5a4f4e2954ba3f4fd542d62886de997b.mp4?t=1755174017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cost for cards. 4 kinds(attack, defend, skill, assistant) instead. They have different rules to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/9e9dc43f842416144866cfa3c315a5f0.poster.avif?t=1755174017\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746910/extras/9e9dc43f842416144866cfa